1
00:00:00,965 --> 00:00:04,385
(Sheldon:)In fact, I'm going to begin
preparing my defense right now.

2
00:00:05,761 --> 00:00:08,101
(Howard:)Okay, he's going to jail.

3
00:00:08,889 --> 00:00:12,139
(Leonard(after Raj whispers to him):)Oh, that's right.
Thursday's Stan Lee day.

4
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:16,148
(Sheldon:)Now you see what you've done?

5
00:00:17,148 --> 00:00:20,608
(Sheldon:)Because of you,
we're all going to miss Stan Lee.

6
00:00:21,694 --> 00:00:22,824
(Leonard:)Whoa!

7
00:00:24,196 --> 00:00:26,986
-What do you mean "all"?
-Well, you're my friends.

8
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:29,658
(Sheldon:)You'll be standing by my side,
supporting me...

9
00:00:29,827 --> 00:00:32,867
(Sheldon:)...feeding me legal precedents,
and, if you have the strength...

10
00:00:33,038 --> 00:00:36,208
(Sheldon:)...carrying me out on your shoulders
when I'm victorious.

11
00:00:37,042 --> 00:00:39,632
(Leonard:)Yeah, okay, no.

12
00:00:39,795 --> 00:00:43,175
(Sheldon:)Are you saying that you will not stand
beside me as I plead my case?

13
00:00:43,507 --> 00:00:45,177
(Leonard:)That's what I'm saying.

14
00:00:45,718 --> 00:00:47,508
(Sheldon:)-Howard?
-Wow. Ahem.

15
00:00:47,678 --> 00:00:51,218
(Howard:)Uh, Stan Lee or you in court.

16
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:55,440
(Howard:)Uh, if this was Sophie's Choice,
it would've been a much shorter movie. No.

17
00:00:56,061 --> 00:00:58,021
Raj, you'll be there, won't you?

